    Modifications: Rust → TypeScript; Aho-Corasick → plain substring/regex;
    flate2 → pako; CCR store handled by caller.

  src/lib/headroom-engine/text-compressor.ts
    Ported from: crates/headroom-core/src/signals/keyword_detector.rs
                 crates/headroom-core/src/signals/line_importance.rs
    Modifications: Rust → TypeScript; Aho-Corasick → plain includes/regex;
